(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY - DSIR) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRISM SCHEME \(PROMOTING INNOVATIONS IN INDIVIDUALS, START-UPS AND MSMES\) \(PRISM\) / DEPARTMENT OF SCIENTIFIC AND INDUSTRIAL RESEARCH \(DSIR\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Grants up to Rs. 50 Lakh for individual innovators and MSMEs to translate) Tj
T*
(novel, green, and industrial technical concepts into marketable working) Tj
T*
(prototypes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Any individual innovator or registered micro/small enterprise with a) Tj
T*
(   novel technology idea.) Tj
T*
(2. Proposal must demonstrate novelty, techno-commercial feasibility, and) Tj
T*
(   potential for patent protection.) Tj
T*
(3. Cost of project evaluated across Phase I \(Proof of Concept, max Rs. 5 Lakh\)) Tj
T*
(   and Phase II \(Working Prototype, max Rs. 50 Lakh\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Grant-in-aid covering up to 90% of project cost for Phase I \(up to Rs. 5) Tj
T*
(   Lakh\) and up to 50% of project cost for Phase II \(up to Rs. 50 Lakh\).) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 50.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 50.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. PRISM Application Form with technical description) Tj
T*
(2. Patent search or patent application copy) Tj
T*
(3. Quotations for machinery/components) Tj
T*
(4. KYC and registration certificates \(GST/Udyam if entity\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Submission through designated PRISM Centers \(TOCICs\) or DSIR portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.dsir.gov.in/#files/prism/index.html) Tj
T*
ET
